    "markdown": "---\ntitle: \"juphyter\"\nsubtitle: \"A Jupyter and Quarto kernel for PHP\"\njupyter: php\n---\n\nRun PHP in Jupyter notebooks and Quarto documents, with tables and charts\ndisplayed alongside code.\n\nA notebook is a file of cells, each holding a few lines of code with its\noutput beneath it. The program that runs the cells is a kernel. juphyter is a\nkernel for PHP, and it keeps one PHP session open, so a variable set in one\ncell is available in the next.\n\n- **JupyterLab:** after `juphyter install`, JupyterLab lists PHP in its\n  launcher. See [JupyterLab](jupyter.qmd).\n- **Quarto:** a `.qmd` that names `jupyter: php` in its front matter renders\n  its `{php}` cells to HTML, PDF, or Word. See [Quarto](quarto.qmd).\n\n## Cell output {#what-a-cell-shows}\n\nThe value of a cell's last expression is its output. A\n[phibble](https://phibble.phpstats.org) data frame appears as an HTML table\nwith its dimensions and column types, and a\n[phiz](https://phiz.phpstats.org) plot appears as a chart. Other values appear\nas a compact dump.\n\nThe examples below use phibble, phplyr, and phiz. In a Composer project,\ninstall them with the command below. The `php` kernel then loads the\nproject's `vendor/autoload.php` for any notebook or document inside the\nproject. [The PHPstats packages](install.qmd#the-phpstats-packages) covers\nusing them outside a project.\n\n```bash\ncomposer require phpstats/phibble phpstats/phplyr phpstats/phiz\n```\n\nThe examples read [mtcars](https://github.com/phpstats/datasets#mtcars) from\nthe PHPstats datasets repository: fuel economy and design measures of 32 cars\nfrom R's `datasets` package. phplyr's `round()` replaces PHP's built-in\n`round()` in the cells after this import.\n\n::: {#1d4600b6 .cell execution_count=1}\n``` {.php .cell-code}\nuse function Phplyr\\{phplyr, group_by, summarize, arrange, desc, n, mean, round};\n```\n:::\n\n\n::: {.panel-tabset group=\"syntax\"}\n\n## PHP 8.5+\n\n::: {#640ccd93 .cell execution_count=2}\n``` {.php .cell-code}\n$mtcars = \\Phibble\\DataFrame::fromCsv(\n    'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/'\n    .'phpstats/datasets/main/csv/mtcars.csv'\n);\n\n$mtcars |>\n    group_by('gear') |>\n    summarize(cars: n(), mpg: round(mean('mpg'), 1)) |>\n    arrange(desc('mpg'));\n```\n\n::: {.cell-output .cell-output-display execution_count=2}\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"juphyter-table\">\n<style>.juphyter-table{font-family:var(--jp-code-font-family,ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace);font-size:var(--jp-code-font-size,0.85em);color:var(--jp-content-font-color1,#111827)}.juphyter-table .juphyter-note{color:var(--jp-content-font-color2,#6b7280);margin:0.15em 0}.juphyter-table table{border-collapse:collapse;margin:0.3em 0}.juphyter-table th,.juphyter-table td{padding:0.1em 0.75em 0.1em 0;text-align:left;white-space:nowrap}.juphyter-table thead th{border-bottom:1px solid var(--jp-border-color2,#d1d5db)}.juphyter-table .juphyter-num{text-align:right}.juphyter-table .juphyter-rowid{color:var(--jp-content-font-color3,#9ca3af);font-weight:normal;text-align:right}.juphyter-table .juphyter-type{color:var(--jp-content-font-color2,#6b7280);font-weight:normal}.juphyter-table .juphyter-na{color:var(--jp-content-font-color3,#9ca3af)}</style>\n<div class=\"juphyter-note\">A tibble: 3 × 3</div>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr><th class=\"juphyter-rowid\"></th><th class=\"juphyter-num\">gear <span class=\"juphyter-type\">&lt;int&gt;</span></th><th class=\"juphyter-num\">cars <span class=\"juphyter-type\">&lt;int&gt;</span></th><th class=\"juphyter-num\">mpg <span class=\"juphyter-type\">&lt;dbl&gt;</span></th></tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr><th class=\"juphyter-rowid\">1</th><td class=\"juphyter-num\">4</td><td class=\"juphyter-num\">12</td><td class=\"juphyter-num\">24.5</td></tr>\n<tr><th class=\"juphyter-rowid\">2</th><td class=\"juphyter-num\">5</td><td class=\"juphyter-num\">5</td><td class=\"juphyter-num\">21.4</td></tr>\n<tr><th class=\"juphyter-rowid\">3</th><td class=\"juphyter-num\">3</td><td class=\"juphyter-num\">15</td><td class=\"juphyter-num\">16.1</td></tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n```\n:::\n:::\n\n\n## PHP 8.3–8.4\n\n::: {#b20e2819 .cell execution_count=3}\n``` {.php .cell-code}\n$mtcars = \\Phibble\\DataFrame::fromCsv(\n    'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/'\n    .'phpstats/datasets/main/csv/mtcars.csv'\n);\n\nphplyr($mtcars)\n    ->groupBy('gear')\n    ->summarize(cars: n(), mpg: round(mean('mpg'), 1))\n    ->arrange(desc('mpg'))\n    ->get();\n```\n\n::: {.cell-output .cell-output-display execution_count=3}\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"juphyter-table\">\n<style>.juphyter-table{font-family:var(--jp-code-font-family,ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace);font-size:var(--jp-code-font-size,0.85em);color:var(--jp-content-font-color1,#111827)}.juphyter-table .juphyter-note{color:var(--jp-content-font-color2,#6b7280);margin:0.15em 0}.juphyter-table table{border-collapse:collapse;margin:0.3em 0}.juphyter-table th,.juphyter-table td{padding:0.1em 0.75em 0.1em 0;text-align:left;white-space:nowrap}.juphyter-table thead th{border-bottom:1px solid var(--jp-border-color2,#d1d5db)}.juphyter-table .juphyter-num{text-align:right}.juphyter-table .juphyter-rowid{color:var(--jp-content-font-color3,#9ca3af);font-weight:normal;text-align:right}.juphyter-table .juphyter-type{color:var(--jp-content-font-color2,#6b7280);font-weight:normal}.juphyter-table .juphyter-na{color:var(--jp-content-font-color3,#9ca3af)}</style>\n<div class=\"juphyter-note\">A tibble: 3 × 3</div>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr><th class=\"juphyter-rowid\"></th><th class=\"juphyter-num\">gear <span class=\"juphyter-type\">&lt;int&gt;</span></th><th class=\"juphyter-num\">cars <span class=\"juphyter-type\">&lt;int&gt;</span></th><th class=\"juphyter-num\">mpg <span class=\"juphyter-type\">&lt;dbl&gt;</span></th></tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr><th class=\"juphyter-rowid\">1</th><td class=\"juphyter-num\">4</td><td class=\"juphyter-num\">12</td><td class=\"juphyter-num\">24.5</td></tr>\n<tr><th class=\"juphyter-rowid\">2</th><td class=\"juphyter-num\">5</td><td class=\"juphyter-num\">5</td><td class=\"juphyter-num\">21.4</td></tr>\n<tr><th class=\"juphyter-rowid\">3</th><td class=\"juphyter-num\">3</td><td class=\"juphyter-num\">15</td><td class=\"juphyter-num\">16.1</td></tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n```\n:::\n:::\n\n\n:::\n\n::: {#3aa87e2a .cell execution_count=4}\n``` {.php .cell-code}\n\\Phiz\\Plot::of($mtcars)\n    ->aes(x: 'wt', y: 'mpg')\n    ->point()\n    ->smooth(method: 'lm')\n    ->labs(x: 'Weight (1,000 lb)', y: 'Miles per gallon');\n```\n\n::: {.cell-output .cell-output-display execution_count=4}\n```{=html}\n<div data-phiz=\"{&quot;$schema&quot;:&quot;https://vega.github.io/schema/vega-lite/v6.json&quot;,&quot;data&quot;:{&quot;values&quot;:[{&quot;rownames&quot;:&quot;Mazda RX4&quot;,&quot;mpg&quot;:21.0,&quot;cyl&quot;:6,&quot;disp&quot;:160.0,&quot;hp&quot;:110,&quot;drat&quot;:3.9,&quot;wt&quot;:2.62,&quot;qsec&quot;:16.46,&quot;vs&quot;:0,&quot;am&quot;:1,&quot;gear&quot;:4,&quot;carb&quot;:4},{&quot;rownames&quot;:&quot;Mazda RX4 Wag&quot;,&quot;mpg&quot;:21.0,&quot;cyl&quot;:6,&quot;disp&quot;:160.0,&quot;hp&quot;:110,&quot;drat&quot;:3.9,&quot;wt&quot;:2.875,&quot;qsec&quot;:17.02,&quot;vs&quot;:0,&quot;am&quot;:1,&quot;gear&quot;:4,&quot;carb&quot;:4},{&quot;rownames&quot;:&quot;Datsun 710&quot;,&quot;mpg&quot;:22.8,&quot;cyl&quot;:4,&quot;disp&quot;:108.0,&quot;hp&quot;:93,&quot;drat&quot;:3.85,&quot;wt&quot;:2.32,&quot;qsec&quot;:18.61,&quot;vs&quot;:1,&quot;am&quot;:1,&quot;gear&quot;:4,&quot;carb&quot;:1},{&quot;rownames&quot;:&quot;Hornet 4 Drive&quot;,&quot;mpg&quot;:21.4,&quot;cyl&quot;:6,&quot;disp&quot;:258.0,&quot;hp&quot;:110,&quot;drat&quot;:3.08,&quot;wt&quot;:3.215,&quot;qsec&quot;:19.44,&quot;vs&quot;:1,&quot;am&quot;:0,&quot;gear&quot;:3,&quot;carb&quot;:1},{&quot;rownames&quot;:&quot;Hornet Sportabout&quot;,&quot;mpg&quot;:18.7,&quot;cyl&quot;:8,&quot;disp&quot;:360.0,&quot;hp&quot;:175,&quot;